nt": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Continuous Tense - I, You", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about current actions - things that are happening NOW.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  What are you doing? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I am studying.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the verb  <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and  <span class=\"strong\">verb-ing</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"03\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Subject </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">To be </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb-ing </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"studying.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eating.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "To ask a question use the structure:  <span class=\"italic\">What are you doing?</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking How Much Things Cost", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the phrase \u201cHow much \u2026 ?\u201d to ask the amount of money you have to give when you buy something.</br></br>In a store, you can also ask, \"What's the price of ... ?\"", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Customer</span>: How much is the coffee?<br><span class=\"strong\"> Clerk</span>:  It is $3.50.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Customer</span>: What's the price of this new phone?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Can I help you? ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what a sales clerk asks a customer ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:     Can I help you? <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>:     Yes, one coffee, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a coffee shop.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cappuccino ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "espresso with hot milk and foam", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like a cappuccino for breakfast.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "espresso ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " strong black coffee  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I drink espresso every day. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "medium ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "average size ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I drink a medium coffee every morning.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fresh ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "new ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm making a fresh pot of coffee now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to order ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask for something in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am ordering a coffee.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "juice", "type": "name"}, {"content": "liquid from fruit or vegetables", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  This orange juice is delicious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "glass ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a container we use to drink from", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I have a glass of juice please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "water ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " H2O; a clear liquid we drink", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I have a glass of water, please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue between you and a barista.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask how much things cost.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 6 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue in class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about ordering a coffee.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask how much things cost.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}